      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Described here is a case of obstruction of the ileal loop caused by a volvulus forming on an internal hernia through the mesenteric opening following left laparoscopic-assisted hemicolectomy. The clinical radiologic, pathogenic and therapeutic aspects are described with review of the literature."},
